ortal. Fills that in from\ninfra-help-assistant.yml''s actual input list, and adds the 4-layer\nverification order (agent content vs. publish vs. RBAC vs. service\nconnection) worked out during today''s 403 debugging, so someone\nsetting this up cold doesn''t have to rediscover it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57a349f5713c40133398aac4ba3ff80ff9ec9f5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/57a349f5713c40133398aac4ba3ff80ff9ec9f5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/6d893aa9b9a5475f3c0d902d39ec090fb88dcc9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/6d893aa9b9a5475f3c0d902d39ec090fb88dcc9c","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKDZkODkzYWE5YjlhNTQ3NWYzYzBkOTAyZDM5ZWMwOTBmYjg4ZGNjOWM","paren