0 RU/s was\nfree-tier-covered — the rest billed continuously. Declaring shared\nthroughput on BookStoreDB lets all containers draw from one\nfree-tier-covered pool instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae85e59f98e1e3ec81c4ef1b105dcbef3fdb686c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/ae85e59f98e1e3ec81c4ef1b105dcbef3fdb686c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/d860a5101c15f8c391195eb788927845df8d79ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/d860a5101c15f8c391195eb788927845df8d79ba","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKGQ4NjBhNTEwMWMxNWY4YzM5MTE5NWViNzg4OTI3ODQ1ZGY4ZDc5YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8","sha":"2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8"}],"sha":"d860a5101c15f8c391195eb788927845df8d79ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/d860a5101c15f8c391195eb788927845df8d79ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:51:25Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:51:25Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Remove authorizationPolicy block — docs/live-API mismatch on this preview version\n\nDeployment failed: \"Missing discriminator property [AuthorizationScheme] in\nrequest body.\" The static docs for 2026-05-15-preview (fetched directly,\nversion-pinned, not just \"latest\") still show `type` as the discriminator\nproperty for authorizationPolicy, contradicting what the live service\nactually demanded. Rather than guess at the correct property name for an\nadmittedly unstable preview schema, dropped the block entirely — Microsoft''s\nown Agent Applications how-to guide states authorizationPolicy defaults to\n\"Default (Azure RBAC)\" when omitted, which is exactly the behavior wanted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0ec3ffcfee2c41633212c4deaf3b5e7c85dc43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/f0ec3ffcfee2c41633212c4deaf3b5e7c85dc43f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKDJiZDIzMTE0YmM0ZDk1NzZkYmJjYTVhZGRiYzEyMjRjMWFhNzdhYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32","sha":"f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32"}],"sha":"2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/2bd23114bc4d9576dbbca5addbc1224c1aa77ac8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:41:10Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:41:10Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Fix Agent Application publish: 2025-12-01 isn''t a registered API version\n\nDeployment failed: \"No registered resource provider found for location\n''southindia'' and API version ''2025-12-01'' for type\n''accounts/projects/applications''. The supported api-versions are\n2025-10-01-preview, 2026-01-15-preview, 2026-03-15-preview,\n2026-05-15-preview.\" (southindia itself was fine — it''s in the supported\nlocations list; the version was the actual problem.) There''s currently no GA\nversion of this resource type despite 2025-12-01 looking like one in the\nstatic docs reference I originally used. Switched both the applications and\nagentDeployments resources to 2026-05-15-preview, the latest confirmed-\nsupported version from the live error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2fe2a713db26793f12286b2c235ab4d91ca9f5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/f2fe2a713db26793f12286b2c235ab4d91ca9f5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKGYzOGY0NGYxZjNlOTA4ZGVhZjcyN2U5YWYzYmQ0NWY0MWQ1MjZlMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/b5008e8a97b590d3ad764b34166af5c01758c252","sha":"b5008e8a97b590d3ad764b34166af5c01758c252","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/b5008e8a97b590d3ad764b34166af5c01758c252"}],"sha":"f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/f38f44f1f3e908deaf727e9af3bd45f41d526e32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/b5008e8a97b590d3ad764b34166af5c01758c252/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:15:06Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T17:15:06Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Move AI Search to centralindia (Semantic Ranker unsupported in southindia)\n\nConfirmed empirically: Foundry''s Knowledge Base failed with \"Knowledge Base\nrequires Semantic Search to be enabled for this service\" against our\nFree-tier search service in southindia. Recreating the identical Free-tier\nservice in centralindia fixed it with no other change — ruling out pricing\ntier as the cause (Free tier does support Semantic Ranker via its \"free\nagentic retrieval plan\", confirmed in the portal) and confirming this is\nregion availability, not a paid-tier requirement.\n\n- infra/ai-foundry.bicep: new searchLocation param (default centralindia),\n  used only by the aiSearch resource. Foundry account/project/model\n  deployments stay on the shared `location` param (southindia default) since\n  gpt-5-mini needs that region instead — the two resources don''t need to be\n  co-located.\n- Also reapplies the -d '''' fix (HTTP 411 on bodyless indexer reset/run POSTs)\n  from the previous session, which got reverted when that edit was\n  interrupted before it was committed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45cb01678e86c4398d42324de99f2d3dbf33eb15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/45cb01678e86c4398d42324de99f2d3dbf33eb15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commit