s{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/fa9258d664a09cb14f99f85ef7b3f6254649a93e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T16:32:01Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T16:32:01Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Add semantic configuration to the index — required by Foundry Knowledge Base\n\nThe Foundry portal''s \"Create a knowledge source\" dialog showed\nbookstore-help-index as \"(missing semantic configuration)\" and blocked\nselecting it. Verified the exact schema against Microsoft''s official\n\"Configure Semantic Ranker\" doc (its REST examples, not an AI-summarized\nparaphrase, which first suggested the wrong top-level key) before pushing:\ntop-level key is \"semantic\" (not \"semanticSearch\", despite vectorSearch using\nthat suffix — inconsistent naming, but confirmed from two real REST examples\non the same page). titleField -> title, prioritizedContentFields -> chunk_text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c5a250bd6248835863aa7c5d045f5edbfacc9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/3c5a250bd6248835863aa7c5d045f5edbfacc9de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/fa9258d664a09cb14f99f85ef7b3f6254649a93e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/fa9258d664a09cb14f99f85ef7b3f6254649a93e","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKGZhOTI1OGQ2NjRhMDljYjE0Zjk5Zjg1ZWY3YjNmNjI1NDY0OWE5M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8","sha":"05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8"}],"sha":"fa9258d664a09cb14f99f85ef7b3f6254649a93e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/fa9258d664a09cb14f99f85ef7b3f6254649a93e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:56:45Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:56:45Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Delete-and-recreate the indexer too; stop discarding reset/run response codes\n\nPortal execution history showed only ONE run ever (100ms, 0 docs, from the\nvery first auto-triggered execution before blob had any files) despite\nmultiple explicit reset+run calls across separate workflow runs since. Root\ncause: that first run got the indexer wedged reporting \"running\"\nindefinitely, and every subsequent /run call against a stuck indexer was\nalmost certainly rejected (e.g. 409) — silently, since the script discarded\nthose calls'' response codes with -o /dev/null and never checked them.\n\n- Delete the indexer object itself before recreating it, same reasoning as\n  the index delete-and-recreate added earlier: cheap to rebuild, and a fresh\n  object carries no stuck execution state\n- Capture and print the HTTP status of the reset/run calls instead of\n  discarding them, with an explicit warning if /run isn''t 2xx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3aee4dcdc20d8c42b6355aa2d6891a8c93971b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/3aee4dcdc20d8c42b6355aa2d6891a8c93971b71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKDA1YzViN2Y5MGFmZjNiYTczMmUzMjdkYWUzYTgzMTlkNGMyMGVlYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1","sha":"c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1"}],"sha":"05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/05c5b7f90aff3ba732e327dae3a8319d4c20eea8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:43:21Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:43:21Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Fix indexer polling: check top-level status, not lastResult.status\n\nLast run''s diagnostic output was misleading — it printed the same stale\nlastResult (startTime 15:24:06) as before, even right after an explicit\nreset+run. Root cause: lastResult.status reflects the PREVIOUS completed\nrun''s outcome and stays \"success\" even while a new run is actively in\nprogress; the indexer''s current execution state is the top-level \"status\"\nfield (running/idle), not lastResult.status. The polling loop was checking\nthe wrong field, so it exited on attempt 1 every time without ever actually\nwaiting for the new run to finish.\n\nNot a setup problem on the user''s end — this was a bug in the diagnostic\nscript itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0ab431002e92ed814178cdde416f6095e63d9d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/b0ab431002e92ed814178cdde416f6095e63d9d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKGM3OGZmOTE5NjFiM2FhMTlmYmJjZDk4M2E2Nzk0Yzc4ZmFjNTJiYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/f2caaa5a71e38e7f5526990c1bb3f3b840cf6666","sha":"f2caaa5a71e38e7f5526990c1bb3f3b840cf6666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/f2caaa5a71e38e7f5526990c1bb3f3b840cf6666"}],"sha":"c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/c78ff91961b3aa19fbbcd983a6794c78fac52bb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/f2caaa5a71e38e7f5526990c1bb3f3b840cf6666/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:39:34Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:39:34Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"Force full indexer re-crawl and poll to completion instead of a fixed sleep 5\n\nLast run reported itemsProcessed: 0 despite files being in blob — the\nlastResult shown was actually stale (startTime 12 minutes before this run;\nsleep 5 wasn''t enough for the new run to start and overwrite it), and\nlastFullEnumerationStartTime was still the epoch, meaning the indexer never\ncompleted a real full crawl. Its change-tracking high-water mark was likely\npast the blobs'' upload time from an earlier attempt, so it kept skipping them\nas \"already seen.\"\n\n- Explicitly POST /reset before /run to clear that change-tracking state and\n  force a genuine full re-crawl every time, instead of relying on PUT''s\n  implicit (and apparently incremental-only) run-on-create behavior\n- Poll status every 5s up to 2 minutes instead of a single sleep 5, and print\n  itemsProcessed/itemsFailed with an explicit warning if 0 items were\n  processed, so this is diagnosable from the log instead of silently \"success\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47e9d2e4f110673f80a23cc243dd2bbd042c50ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/47e9d2e4f110673f80a23cc243dd2bbd042c50ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/f