//api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/5d54ebfb0906be1cf0d7d8458807b6d04f103c6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:34:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:35:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(ai): point AiService chat deployment at gpt-5-mini\n\ngpt-4o-mini wasn''t available for Standard/Global Standard deployment\nin the separately-provisioned Azure OpenAI resource (East US), and\ngpt-4o''s default version is deprecating. gpt-5-mini deployed\nsuccessfully instead, so both the config default and the code-level\nfallback now match the actual deployment name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P52uD1mDmxp3wcsnVfrn72","tree":{"sha":"56249a20f00c2f20589bc5ee0f65c2c419c21311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/56249a20f00c2f20589bc5ee0f65c2c419c21311"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/5d54ebfb0906be1cf0d7d8458807b6d04f103c6b","verification":{"payload":"tree 56249a20f00c2f20589bc5ee0f65c2c419c21311\nparent 3189f971d6c433919f47623e2fc9caff06c516ab\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784792042 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784792122 +0000\n\nfix(ai): point AiService chat deployment at gpt-5-mini\n\ngpt-4o-mini wasn''t available for Standard/Global Standard deployment\nin the separately-provisioned Azure OpenAI resource (East US), and\ngpt-4o''s default version is deprecating. gpt-5-mini deployed\nsuccessfully instead, so both the config default and the code-level\nfallback now match the actual deployment name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P52uD1mDmxp3wcsnVfrn72\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4