ments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:01:46Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:01:46Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"fix(ui): suppress generic 404 toast on inventory page\n\nThe component already treats a 404 as a normal \"never stocked yet\" empty\nstate and renders a friendly message for it, but the request never opted out\nof the global error interceptor''s generic toast — so viewing inventory for a\nnew product showed a contradictory \"Something went wrong (404)\" snackbar on\ntop of the correct empty-state message. Matches the same SUPPRESS_404_TOAST\npattern already used in product-list''s add-to-cart check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14dd3fbf093229cd367cb22d75cfd03171005de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/14dd3fbf093229cd367cb22d75cfd03171005de6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/22d9ba5fc10aa91189d966e19679b6fceb1e037f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/22d9ba5fc10aa91189d966e19679b6fceb1e037f","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKDIyZDliYTVmYzEwYWE5MTE4OWQ5NjZlMTk2NzliNmZjZWIxZTAzN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/3c0660764f90d18aceae5f0fefc725f5a6342ee3","sha":"3c0660764f90d18aceae5f0fefc725f5a6342ee3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/3c0660764f90d18aceae5f0fefc725f5a6342ee3"}],"sha":"22d9ba5fc10aa91189d966e19679b6fceb1e037f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/22d9ba5fc10aa91189d966e19679b6fceb1e037f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/3c0660764f90d18aceae5f0fefc725f5a6342ee3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:54:54Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:54:54Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"fix(ui): add price/category to product form, add inventory restock UI\n\n- Product Add/Edit form was missing Price and Category fields entirely,\n  even though the backend and Product model both support them. Edit was\n  actively destructive: patching a form with no price control then\n  submitting it back overwrote the product''s price to 0 on every save.\n- Add a restock form to the Inventory page calling the existing\n  POST /api/Inventory endpoint, which the UI never had a way to reach —\n  every new product starts at 0 stock server-side and previously could\n  only be restocked via Swagger/curl.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb8cb03ffcb4baa59058fa204b60e34058a835e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/bb8cb03ffcb4baa59058fa204b60e34058a835e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/3c0660764f90d18aceae5f0fefc725f5a6342ee3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c