},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:48:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: add validate-ef-migrations job for OrderService/PaymentService (#35)\n\n* ci: add validate-ef-migrations job for OrderService/PaymentService\n\nCloses the gap between docs/ROADMAP.md''s Phase 2 pipeline plan and the\nactual ci.yml: EF Core migrations had no CI check for drift (a model\nchange with no matching migration, a broken design-time factory), unlike\nHelm/Bicep which already get validated. Uses `migrations script` so it\nnever needs a live SQL connection.\n\n* ci: harden validate-ef-migrations job per PR #35 review\n\n- Set persist-credentials: false on its Checkout step, matching the other\n  build-*/validate-* jobs that don''t push back to git.\n- Add `dotnet ef migrations has-pending-model-changes` for both\n  OrderDbContext and PaymentDbContext. `migrations script` alone never\n  detected an entity change with no matching migration scaffolded -\n  has-pending-model-changes is the command that actually diffs the model\n  against the last migration snapshot.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a698508794736bb316870ac08ea9fcbe989fff91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/a698508794736bb316870ac08ea9fcbe989fff91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/7910f1d6c0ffc9522ec92f97ad1afefc8bd310cf","verification":{"payload":"tree a698508794736bb316870ac08ea9fcbe989fff91\nparent e347033fc82da694d245cabbbe6b2ed76a3b0b58\nauthor ankitgoelmalviyans <157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com> 1784699336 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784699336 +0530\n\nci: add validate-ef-migrations job for OrderService/PaymentService (#35)\n\n* ci: add validate-ef-migrations job for OrderService/PaymentService\n\nCloses the gap between docs/ROADMAP.md''s Phase 2 pipeline plan and the\nactual ci.yml: EF Core migrations had no CI check for drift (a model\nchange with no matching migration, a broken design-time factory), unlike\nHelm/Bicep which already get validated. Uses `migrations script` so it\nnever needs a live SQL connection.\n\n* ci: harden validate-ef-migrations job per PR #35 review\n\n- Set persist-credentials: false on its Checkout step, matching the other\n  build-*/validate-* jobs that don''t push back to git.\n- Add `dotnet ef migrations has-pending-model-changes` for both\n  OrderDbContext and PaymentDbContext. `migrations script` alone never\n  detected an entity change with no matching migration scaffolded -\n  has-pending-model-changes is the command that actually diffs the model\n  against the last migration snapshot.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYFnICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd/gQAATwzzbaw3srFFPCKc02Lq+X\nu0CnQJGUpGkzETPvVk+nsZfQ/2WOr6/DWLzOfeckSjqWMjgpnWso7sl/xGYklhDt\ncnXpq9KuFMACi+O9kBOmfuakoklZ+sWwFlDYX3avefyQcDITYVB+UubpvIG49Urp\nVWryHxtkfpp3JG4c5tYeEmEHKMwDMi5vTgTRboxfQoPuzmVTKhGWDUBBKq7nyMHh\n6e+g7XfIMSP3HjFwYDo1jK7ldNBVw4mVygS8EB2aDYaafz4WtcsTBs3Va5e4/vjQ\nebNZ2UumfbRuSZD7rAdRfu0pW9oR3DF8leM00B1O9WHM5ZG9KLMIrWyyb+ZJ2qjT\nzP8i9e8KVoMES5CrbbxN1IYw3VxNqYwK2pQ4kBvjvdxLjQO4rJlcwKEz2oyiWyEw\nevNZMpgVM7Z7jKf+KZ4nUdn/Nyr46JZTFGlMi9/cTUQHQX+fQ7vI7mfk78D7d3rI\n4jUMKQQVUM2J/hQE4qBrYsG/RLvfSXZHlQrnXaXcOYHYr6kjKywv7V7/xDtq0D/4\n9jRjiGnvZ0PBpJKklSmBXd990QTwWpDyL0+fBCSurXNrGtRgGzFRJhCCYc3pzkEI\npbQGumUW/LU3d5ItMd+qZmXq/0T9oiv1ey66fQpsMPcFQkGFryTufmIY8mOEzHoN\nMxgoGrBhMavccsp4vFyf\n=9qvl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-22T05:48:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gi