https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/8dd41f8b7685b484b8b34faaabbd94321cd01434/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:56:53Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:56:53Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"fix(ef): enable retry-on-failure in design-time DbContext factories\n\nServerless auto-pause means the first connection during `dotnet ef database\nupdate` in CD can hit transient error 40613 (database resuming) — the\nruntime path already had EnableRetryOnFailure(), the design-time factories\ndidn''t.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3b7179b8ed4f7161e88164036164aca98e68b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/f3b7179b8ed4f7161e88164036164aca98e68b7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/8dd41f8b7685b484b8b34faaabbd94321cd01434","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/8dd41f8b7685b484b8b34faaabbd94321cd01434","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKDhkZDQxZjhiNzY4NWI0ODRiOGIzNGZhYWFiYmQ5NDMyMWNkMDE0MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/7a7058a326ba1a898e3482064ecdb45bddaa3bf6","sha":"7a7058a326ba1a898e3482064ecdb45bddaa3bf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/7a7058a326ba1a898e3482064ecdb45bddaa3bf6"}],"sha":"8dd41f8b7685b484b8b34faaabbd94321cd01434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/8dd41f8b7685b484b8b34faaabbd94321cd01434"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157928570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/7a7058a326ba1a898e3482064ecdb45bddaa3bf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:38:47Z","email":"157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:38:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Product UI (#30)\n\n* infra(bicep): add the Phase 2 Service Bus saga topology\n\nDefine the three saga topics and their subscriptions in main.bicep so the\nmessaging layer the gated services depend on can be provisioned:\n- order-events    → inventory-order-subscription, notification-order-subscription\n- inventory-events→ payment-subscription, order-inventory-outcome-subscription\n- payment-events  → order-payment-outcome-subscription, notification-payment-subscription\n\nCheap and idempotent (the Standard namespace already exists), validated by the\nexisting validate-bicep CI job. Azure SQL Serverless (the always-on cost driver)\nand the cd-costopt deploy wiring are deliberately held back — merging a Bicep\nchange auto-triggers infra-bicep, so provisioning SQL is an operator decision;\ndocumented in docs/ROADMAP.md.\n\n* AzureSqlServer changes in pipeline and added Seed data\n\n* fix: address code review findings on Phase 2 SQL/CD wiring\n\n* feat(ui): add Order/Payment UI, app shell, and route guards to product-ui\n\n- New lazy-loaded OrdersModule (first real loadChildren in this app): My\n  Orders history, a client-side cart-based checkout, and order detail that\n  polls while Status=Pending so the saga''s async reserve->charge resolves\n  live instead of requiring a manual refresh\n- Payment status embedded in order detail rather than a standalone page —\n  PaymentService only exposes a lookup-by-order-id, no list endpoint\n- New NavToolbarComponent (brand, nav links, cart badge, login/logout) —\n  AppComponent was previously just a bare <router-outlet>\n- AuthGuard on /products, /inventory, /orders (previously unauthenticated\n  visitors hit silent 401s with no redirect); ErrorInterceptor for global\n  401->logout and 5xx/network toasts\n- Custom brown/teal Material theme replacing the stock indigo-pink prebuilt\n- Fixed two pre-existing bugs found along the way: ProductListComponent''s\n  wrong selector (app-product-form) and InventoryComponent''s dead unused\n  template file\n- cd-ui.yml: ORDER_API_URL/PAYMENT_API_URL token replacement, same pattern\n  as the existing three\n\n* fix: coderabbit suggestions for product-ui\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d2d2ebb3d77d3e809111e33c1ab268babda0d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/2d2d2ebb3d77d3e809111e33c1ab268babda0d0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/7a7058a326ba1a898e3482064ecdb45bddaa3bf6","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d2d2ebb3d77d3e809111e33c1ab268babda0d0f\nparent 07413fc8af2481a092572362c9f9e1ee9b897d56\nauthor ankitgoelmalviyans <157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com> 1784309927 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784309927 +0530\n\nProduct UI (#30)\n\n* infra(bicep): add the Phase 2 Service Bus saga topology\n\nDefine the three saga topics and their subscriptions in main.bicep so the\nmessaging layer the gated services depend on can be provisioned:\n- order-events    → inventory-order-subscription, notification-order-subscription\n- inventory-events→ payment-subscription, order-inventory-outcome-subscription\n- payment-events  → order-payment-outcome-subscription, notification-payment-subscription\n\nCheap and idempotent (the Standard namespace already exists), validated by the\nexisting validate-bicep CI job. Azure SQL Serverless (the always-on cost driver)\nand the cd-costopt deploy wiring are deliberately held back — merging a Bicep\nchange auto-triggers infra-bicep, so provisioning SQL is an operator decision;\ndocumented in docs/ROADMAP.md.\n\n* AzureSqlServer changes in pipeline and added Seed data\n\n* fix: address code review findings on Phase 2 SQL/CD wiring\n\n* feat(ui): add Order/Payment UI, app shell, and route guards to product-ui\n\n- New lazy-loaded OrdersModule (first real loadChildren in this app): My\n  Orders history, a client-side cart-based checkout, and order detail that\n  polls while Status=Pending so the saga''s async reserve->charge resolves\n  live instead of requiring a manual refresh\n- Payment status embedded in order detail rather than a standalone page —\n  PaymentService only exposes a lookup-by-order-id, no list endpoint\n- New NavToolbarComponent (brand, nav links, cart badge, login/logout) —\n  AppComponent was previously just a bare <router-outlet>\n- AuthGuard on /products, /inventory, /orders (previously unauthenticated\n  visitors hit silent 401s with no redirect); ErrorInterceptor for global\n  401->logout and 5xx/network toasts\n- Custom brown/teal Material theme replacing the stock indigo-pink prebuilt\n- Fixed two pre-existing bugs found along the way: ProductListComponent''s\n  wrong selector (app-product-form) and InventoryComponent''s dead unused\n  template file\n- cd-ui.yml: ORDER_API_URL/PAYMENT_API_URL token replacement, same pattern\n  as the existing three\n\n* fix: coderabbit suggestions for product-ui\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWminCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzckQAIA