iptions in main.bicep so the\nmessaging layer the gated services depend on can be provisioned:\n- order-events    → inventory-order-subscription, notification-order-subscription\n- inventory-events→ payment-subscription, order-inventory-outcome-subscription\n- payment-events  → order-payment-outcome-subscription, notification-payment-subscription\n\nCheap and idempotent (the Standard namespace already exists), validated by the\nexisting validate-bicep CI job. Azure SQL Serverless (the always-on cost driver)\nand the cd-costopt deploy wiring are deliberately held back — merging a Bicep\nchange auto-triggers infra-bicep, so provisioning SQL is an operator decision;\ndocumented in docs/ROADMAP.md.\n\n* AzureSqlServer changes in pipeline and added Seed data\n\n* fix: address code review findings on Phase 2 SQL/CD wiring\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47b2ead26dfb3ccf276f4b44142fbfe326ad018c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/47b2ead26dfb3ccf276f4b44142fbfe326ad018c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/07413fc8af2481a092572362c9f9e1ee9b897d56","verification":{"payload":"tree 47b2ead26dfb3ccf276f4b44142fbfe326ad018c\nparent ce8b17c646cd82f74230fffdb1b09dc796069dce\nauthor ankitgoelmalviyans <157928570+ankitgoelmalviyans@users.noreply.github.com> 1784295218 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784295218 +0530\n\nClaude/multi scs architecture planning 26u7p1 (#29)\n\n* infra(bicep): add the Phase 2 Service Bus saga topology\n\nDefine the three saga topics and their subscriptions in main.bicep so the\nmessaging layer the gated services depend on can be provisioned:\n- order-events    → inventory-order-subscription, notification-order-subscription\n- inventory-events→ payment-subscription, order-inventory-outcome-subscription\n- payment-events  → order-payment-outcome-subscription, notification-payment-subscription\n\nCheap and idempotent (the Standard namespace already exists), validated by the\nexisting validate-bicep CI job. Azure SQL Serverless (the always-on cost driver)\nand the cd-costopt deploy wiring are deliberately held back — merging a Bicep\nchange auto-triggers infra-bicep, so provisioning SQL is an operator decision;\ndocumented in docs/ROADMAP.md.\n\n* AzureSqlServer changes in pipeline and added Seed data\n\n* fix: address code review findings on Phase 2 SQL/CD wiring\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWi8yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8IYQACFPoRWAUeMTLah8SzIp8yuj\noY6PlqeE8Nuh65fE1CwZbHvAlg+Xh3qei1rfYNf1nrBU1LOG/4Ork0+ofCkqyRom\noTLFP3C37zQLH2yhZWTuaEi42GKPjAhYk7F5RHyRwbFJJPrL/zXJ1ZAVLPNv/njU\nfdXLBnQSMg8ChPHrt6dVAWX0ay32BU5J3Cj+2Qp09nLsCxlXoMikYra7X9ELU6E9\nrNe4vLvaqNC0h6qODdul/wLMQ1N/CBCYeeJXhvKaxwfkKPnkYjNrBx1gnRZfVHwV\n3jQujDpxYztKvwV23s2VWv4KsmkJGPXTQJPh0Ip1kic5gclq7jXqG5IflGSjFnbR\nZDTbYrA7IAYBI4H/LLe4ogOnKn545xa8/bIrbXQr9JIOf/RrknIjgScnJnIFFxnK\nQGMfEcifmEjhlLd8L7NGQgt/qyz0j/rVCyeKw2UboqvbW6Yuv5B6e1HtQS7Ec4uf\nj7pp57MDClqOte0QfyZXWjkCCInvexmUspDd3I8svulRUnyAMGJkM5nsw4ks8KJ3\n2kx2bYiMfYnNLYyQjT2tRABPLKOFMsxNQYn6tLfYK5TS7s7qy9kmUX1wzcpqHCVL\nZfBcSUbQzU+xnf4XqdoZ1a7KJH2K1QHKw9u+kZt7u+N2Zs05t4yeopvmNOTfErLX\nQXEcG0sml+eBhWoyUOeY\n=NR7B\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T13:33:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"