ankitgoelmalviyans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans","id":157928570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/cc0aaf77a71a97374e9a8038a719f00ff0c97939/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:17:49Z","email":"ankitmalviyans@gmail.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:17:49Z","email":"ankitmalviyans@gmail.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"fix: address CodeRabbit review on PR #17 (decrement validation + concurrency)\n\n- Reject non-positive quantity in TryDecrementStock (both repos): a negative\n  value was slipping past the insufficient-stock check and silently inflating\n  stock instead of decrementing it.\n- Add [Range(1, int.MaxValue)] to StockAdjustmentRequest so the API rejects\n  invalid decrement requests before they reach the repository.\n- CosmosInventoryRepository.TryDecrementStock: replace the plain read-then-write\n  with ETag-based optimistic concurrency (IfMatchEtag) and retry-on-412, closing\n  the TOCTOU window that could let concurrent decrements oversell stock.\n- InMemoryInventoryRepository: add a lock around the read-check-write sequence\n  in both UpdateInventory and TryDecrementStock, since this repo is a Singleton\n  and the list is shared a