/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/45f41ac4dd9da18f47cb9d4147a289b5fa11f917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:37:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:37:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: persist CorrelationId to localStorage for true browser-session scope\n\nWithout this, the Angular interceptor stored the id as a class field which\nreset on every page reload — giving per-SPA-bootstrap granularity, effectively\nthe same as per-request TraceId. Reading/writing localStorage.correlation_id\nmakes the id survive F5 and new tabs so one browser session shares one id\nacross all backend requests and the Service Bus async chain.\n\nAlso updates LLD.md TraceId vs CorrelationId table to document the real\ngranularity difference and the localStorage fix rationale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpZhXMMKhFMvDcfYj98TGH","tree":{"sha":"7f89658df89648d7b9ee174f467f85df8e69f473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/7f89658df89648d7b9ee174f467f85df8e69f473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/45f41ac4dd9da18f47cb9d4147a289b5fa11f917","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f89658df89648d7b9ee174f467f85df8e69f473\nparent f02d35dc49686bc063b28e37d18c8a87c2732c5f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783348669 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783348669 +0000\n\nfix: persist CorrelationId to localStorage for true browser-session scope\n\nWithout this, the Angular interceptor stored the id as a class field which\nreset on every page reload — giving per-SPA-bootstrap granularity, effectively\nthe same as per-request TraceId. Reading/writing localStorage.correlation_id\nmakes the id survive F5 and new tabs so one browser session shares one id\nacross all backend requests and the Service Bus async chain.\n\nAlso updates LLD.md TraceId vs CorrelationId table to document the real\ngranularity difference and the localStorage fix rationale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpZhXMMKhFMvDcfYj98TGH\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHjZvdKX\nZh5w09E9TsaTR9Ni5InL+kUCQfwyraR+1pJBxTOCszhoFSyLy45D22+KiM1mUTXvD1Vw9U3p/4p2\naAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T14:37:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu