://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767","sha":"473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767"}],"sha":"aaf8e31cdc4693ee7b44fd31a01817592b69ac5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/aaf8e31cdc4693ee7b44fd31a01817592b69ac5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T19:22:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T19:22:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: standardize exception handling, pipeline order, and request logging\n\nQuick wins across AuthService, ProductService, and InventoryService:\n\n1. Unified exception handling — all three services now return RFC 9457\n   application/problem+json ProblemDetails including the request''s\n   correlationId, instead of AuthService''s ad-hoc object, ProductService''s\n   plain-text 500, and InventoryService having no global handler.\n   (Duplicated per service since they are separate solutions; a shared\n   library remains the longer-term goal.)\n\n2. Canonical middleware pipeline order shared by all three services:\n   CorrelationId -> RequestLogging -> Exception -> Swagger/UI -> CORS\n   -> Authentication -> Authorization -> [SerilogEnriching] -> endpoints.\n   ProductService''s SerilogEnrichingMiddleware moved after authentication\n   so it can log the authenticated UserName.\n\n3. RequestLoggingMiddleware added to each service — emits a structured\n   completion line with a DurationMs field (health probes excluded),\n   making the documented duration-based Splunk searches return real data.\n\nDocs synced to reflect these fixes (PRD, LLD, DOTNET_CONCEPTS, ROADMAP,\nSPLUNK_GUIDE, splunk-searches).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpZhXMMKhFMvDcfYj98TGH","tree":{"sha":"02f2b2d5605d7b3dc5b9954bbe2b60cd68ba9afc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/02f2b2d5605d7b3dc5b9954bbe2b60cd68ba9afc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767","verification":{"payload":"tree 02f2b2d5605d7b3dc5b9954bbe2b60cd68ba9afc\nparent cb8c1329eb15d57a369c40d3053771b12bee082a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783279370 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783279370 +0000\n\nfeat: standardize exception handling, pipeline order, and request logging\n\nQuick wins across AuthService, ProductService, and InventoryService:\n\n1. Unified exception handling — all three services now return RFC 9457\n   application/problem+json ProblemDetails including the request''s\n   correlationId, instead of AuthService''s ad-hoc object, ProductService''s\n   plain-text 500, and InventoryService having no global handler.\n   (Duplicated per service since they are separate solutions; a shared\n   library remains the longer-term goal.)\n\n2. Canonical middleware pipeline order shared by all three services:\n   CorrelationId -> RequestLogging -> Exception -> Swagger/UI -> CORS\n   -> Authentication -> Authorization -> [SerilogEnriching] -> endpoints.\n   ProductService''s SerilogEnrichingMiddleware moved after authentication\n   so it can log the authenticated UserName.\n\n3. RequestLoggingMiddleware added to each service — emits a structured\n   completion line with a DurationMs field (health probes excluded),\n   making the documented duration-based Splunk searches return real data.\n\nDocs synced to reflect these fixes (PRD, LLD, DOTNET_CONCEPTS, ROADMAP,\nSPLUNK_GUIDE, splunk-searches).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpZhXMMKhFMvDcfYj98TGH\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMVBbi6v\nQvYmdnbv9TYi6ze492IDLU0aK0gU9rvONYS/M+4FKO8fJ909gIb6/BohzRXO+Eqjdx/uyQvApLy3\nTQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T19:22:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767","node_id":"C_kwDOOcYFSNoAKDQ3M2QwYTc2ZTVhM2VmYTdhMjFkZDUzM2JkZWJhMjZkZDMwZWU3Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commit/cb8c1329eb15d57a369c40d3053771b12bee082a","sha":"cb8c1329eb15d57a369c40d3053771b12bee082a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/cb8c1329eb15d57a369c40d3053771b12bee082a"}],"sha":"473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/473d0a76e5a3efa7a21dd533bdeba26dd30ee767"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/cb8c1329eb15d57a369c40d3053771b12bee082a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T18:32:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T18:32:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive technical documentation suite\n\nAdd 10 architect-level technical documents under docs/, grounded in the\nactual BookStore codebase, for interview preparation:\n\n- PRD.md            Product requirements, user stories, scope/out-of-scope\n- TRD.md            14 ADRs, integration points, security architecture\n- HLD.md            System/two-profile/data-flow diagrams, service boundaries\n- LLD.md            Per-service internals, middleware, OpenTelemetry deep dive\n- KUBERNETES.md     AKS ops, Helm, layered debugging, LB health-probe story\n- DOTNET_CONCEPTS.md Pipeline, DI, config, Clean Architecture, routing\n- AZURE_SERVICE_BUS.md Why messaging, topic vs queue, CorrelationId flow\n- SPLUNK_GUIDE.md   Fluent Bit -> Splunk pipeline, 25 searches, alerts\n- ROADMAP.md        Phase 2-5 planned work (CQRS, Saga, Inbox/Outbox, AI)\n- INTERVIEW_QA.md   60 Q&A across overview/arch/k8s/cicd/observability\n\nAll planned features are marked PLANNED; known gaps (best-effort event\npublish, inconsistent exception middleware, no OTLP exporter) are flagged\nhonestly rather than glossed over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpZhXMMKhFMvDcfYj98TGH","tree":{"sha":"b2e3432e36278c1d2561b1671450334728b31c28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/b2e3432e36278c1d2561b1671450334728b31c28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/cb8c1329eb15d57a369c40d3053771b12bee082a","verification":{"payload":"tree b2e3432e36278c1d2561b1671450334728b31c28\nparent bdcb1d2522aa5d81817d3ea1e8e849b906b817cd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783276379 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783276379 +0000\n\ndocs: add comprehensive technical documentation suite\n\nAdd 10 architect-level technical 