28570,"login":"ankitgoelmalviyans","node_id":"U_kgDOCWnMeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitgoelmalviyans","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/commits/5c1a237475fcb6da498639d07bb9c937cbaa1d10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T09:25:21Z","email":"ankitmalviyans@gmail.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T09:25:21Z","email":"ankitmalviyans@gmail.com","name":"ankitgoelmalviyans"},"message":"fix: add [JsonPropertyName(id)] to Product and Inventory for Cosmos DB\n\nCosmos DB rejects documents where the id field is not lowercase ''id''.\nSystem.Text.Json was serializing Guid Id as ''Id'' (uppercase), causing\n400 BadRequest: ''required properties - id; - are missing''.\n\n- Product.cs: [JsonPropertyName(id)] on Id + init Name/Description\n- Inventory.cs: [JsonPropertyName(id)] on Id\n- ProductCreatedEvent.cs: init Name = string.Empty\n- ProductService.cs: null-coalescing fallback for topic name\n- ProductController.cs: remove duplicate using\n- CosmosProductRepository.cs: UpdateAsync throws instead of returning null\n\nBuild: 0 errors, 0 warnings","tree":{"sha":"98ca31b0fb799bc6e85671f968e13a7ba6332ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/trees/98ca31b0fb799bc6e85671f968e13a7ba6332ada"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankitgoelmalviyans/BookStore/git/commits/5c1a237475fcb6da498639d07bb9c937cbaa1d10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified"