n the hero lead, the code card, the stat counter, the \"By the\nnumbers\" heading, and both meta descriptions, plus the same figures in\nthe README.\n\nAlso clarified the 82-month figure: it is the span of the CV''s dated\nproject history, which is no longer the same as the career length, so\nthe chart note now says so rather than calling it \"the calendar span\".\n\nThe GitHub handle stays phuongfullstack, as the repo and site use it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019MQ9owEGMgKkCmFVohYkwc","tree":{"sha":"2ca0149aad7d196010d42e18da5231d388d0038c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuongfullstack/phuongfullstack.github.io/git/trees/2ca0149aad7d196010d42e18da5231d388d0038c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuongfullstack/phuongfullstack.github.io/git/commits/12eca76392330706653c1f19dfc66e74135e034c","verification":{"payload":"tree 2ca0149aad7d196010d42e18da5231d388d0038c\nparent de0ed910830ce7288c816d9267f8fa2f3466f6a5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789927593 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789927593 +0000\n\nCorrect the years of experience to 8\n\nThe CV was written in June 2025 and said \"around 7 years\"; the site\nrepeated it. Counting from the first dated project (August 2018) to\ntoday, it is 8 years.\n\nUpdated in the hero lead, the code card, the stat counter, the \"By the\nnumbers\" heading, and both meta descriptions, plus the same figures in\nthe README.\n\nAlso clarified the 82-month figure: it is the span of the CV''s dated\nproject history, which is no longer the same as the career length, so\nthe chart note now says so rather than calling it \"the calendar span\".\n\nThe GitHub handle stays phuongfullstack, as the repo and site use it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019MQ9owEGMgKkCmFVohYkwc\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAA