uthor":{"date":"2025-10-29T10:35:39Z","email":"mattias800@gmail.com","name":"Mattias Andersson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-29T10:35:39Z","email":"mattias800@gmail.com","name":"Mattias Andersson"},"message":"feat: Add error handling, retry functionality, and keyboard shortcuts\n\nPhase 9 improvements:\n\nError Handling:\n- Enhanced error messages with better context (network errors, auth errors, not found)\n- Added retry buttons to all error states in AlbumDetailPage\n- Improved error UI with icons and better formatting\n- Better distinction between different types of errors\n\nKeyboard Shortcuts:\n- Space: Play/Pause\n- Cmd/Ctrl + Right Arrow: Next track\n- Cmd/Ctrl + Left Arrow: Previous track\n- Cmd/Ctrl + F: Navigate to search\n- Cmd/Ctrl + 1-3: Navigate to Artists/Albums/Playlists\n- Global keyboard shortcut handling in AppScaffold\n\nUX Improvements:\n- Retry functionality for failed album loads\n- Better error state presentation\n- More user-friendly error messages\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d823bdcf737e48400bc17d22afd2789f64935b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattias800/mmusic/git/trees/d823bdcf737e48400bc17d22afd2789f64935b69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattias800/mmusic/git/commits/1ad06a2591ff4801a74f4cccdbec1815369d114f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1266041?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattias800/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattias800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattias800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattias800/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattias800","id":1266041,"login":"mattias800","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjYwNDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.git