rs/xIrusux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-example-bundle/commits/c8324908ade0c19f72748ae0104db3efb2251eb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:02:48Z","email":"42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:02:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add custom dashboards widget example (top_assets) (#33)\n\n* Add custom dashboards widget example (top_assets)\n\nRunnable version of the studio-dashboards-bundle extension guide''s\ntop_assets example widget:\n\n- backend: config repository, hydrator, and data resolver registered via\n  the pimcore.studio_dashboards.widget_* tags; widget configs stored under\n  this bundle''s own config root (pimcore_studio_example_bundle)\n- frontend: widget-type definition registered into the dashboards\n  widget-type registry (resolved by string service id, no deep imports\n  from the dashboards module-federation remote)\n- widget type registered via prependExtensionConfig(''pimcore_studio_dashboards'')\n\nRelated: pimcore/studio-dashboards-bundle#257\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d761f4386e82fc732392a65dc6f74cf6be1d36f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-example-bundle/git/trees/d761f4386e82fc732392a65dc6f74cf6be1d36f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-example-bundle/git/commits/c8324908ade0c19f72748ae0104db3efb2251eb7","verification":{"payload":"tree d761f4386e82fc732392a65dc6f74cf6be1d36f2\nparent b304ac098566582970761b5f8eb3439cf150b4fb\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1783598568 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.co