978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vin0401","id":26813978,"login":"vin0401","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODEzOTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vin0401","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-example-bundle/commits/da57e27ff9cf8963accd2d380a0d6ead6b816d1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T07:22:30Z","email":"marvin.bertram@pimcore.com","name":"Marvin Bertram"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T07:22:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add custom theme example (#34)\n\n* Add Custom Theme example plugin\n\nRegisters CustomThemePlugin demonstrating a custom theme (ocean) via a\ndynamic-type definition and a theme extension module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply eslint-fixer changes\n\n* Bump @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle to canary 20260707-113006-95e2480\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Pin @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle to 2026.2.0\n\nThe custom-theme example imports theme dynamic-type APIs (DynamicTypeThemeAbstract,\nDynamicTypeThemeRegistry, studioThemeIds, PimcoreThemeConfig) that were added after\nthe latest canary was cut. Stable 2026.2.0 is the first published version exporting\nthem, so this fixes the failing CI type check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: vin0401 <26813978+vin0401@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff48b91f5bfca518d41c82f8bfe6b069e8463783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-example-bundle/git/trees/ff48b91f5bfca518d41c82f8bfe6b069e8463783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/studio-example-bundle/git/commits/da57e27ff9cf8963accd2d380a0d6ead6b816d1c","verification":{"payload":"tree ff48b91f5bfca518d41c82f8bfe6b069e8463783\nparent 8c9e31acda28fae1913b68c6f9172ad4568f231b\nauthor Marvin Bertram <marvin.bertram@pimcore.com> 1783495350 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783495350 +0200\n\nAdd custom theme example (#34)\n\n* Add Custom Theme example plugin\n\nRegisters CustomThemePlugin demonstrating a custom theme (ocean) via a\ndynamic-type definition and a theme extension module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply eslint-fixer changes\n\n* Bump @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle to canary 20260707-113006-95e2480\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Pin @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle to 2026.2.0\n\nThe custom-theme example imports theme dynamic-type APIs (DynamicTypeThemeAbstract,\nDynamicTypeThemeRegistry, studioThemeIds, PimcoreThemeConfig) that were added after\nthe latest canary was cut. Stable 2026.2.0 is the first published version exporting\nthem, so this fixes the failing CI type check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: vin0401 <26813978+vin0401@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTfq2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxO4QAFDyVCklKQkMplbP0Gn4m6Va\nxYxE9o17RkC9xG/Zp6KOP7SXlLGrNTgcvYimRFlyOz7mQLhUIlZC57W1Sz/kHzrl\n5hwbRM0L94UUqhESKAwLaf1UjZdNR8RQz